    <h2>How this started</h2>
    <p>For more than 10 years, I've been designing trips for my friends. Year after year, they keep coming back to join me on the next adventure.</p>
    <p>People kept telling me I should open a small travel agency. I finally listened, and that's how Onyx World Travel started.</p>

    <h2>Why I come along</h2>
    <p>Planning a trip is one thing. Being there is another. On my upcoming trips, I take care of everything before we leave and while we're away, so nobody has to worry about a thing.</p>
    <p>My travelers tell me they love that they can just show up with their passports in their hands. They also feel safer knowing someone is with them, especially somewhere they've never been before, like Europe.</p>

    <h2>Who I travel with</h2>
    <p>Mostly folks who'd rather not spend their time planning, and would love to have everything done for them. If that sounds like you, you're in the right place.</p>

    <h2>Where I'm based</h2>
    <p>I'm based in {{ site.region }}. Most of my planning happens online, and if you're local and would rather meet in person, I'm happy to.</p>

